\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_Book_MOO_CreationOfMarcusWings</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_Book_MOO_CreationOfMarcusWings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_Book_MOO_CreationOfMarcusWings\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">b4431865-5b66-4727-8eeb-23b54af2ba1e</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b4431865-5b66-4727-8eeb-23b54af2ba1e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b4431865-5b66-4727-8eeb-23b54af2ba1e\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On the first floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-126&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-195</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Marcus - I assume no explanation is needed for just how rare these appendages are, and I trust you shall make good use of them. You have a golden opportunity to please the <a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\">General</a>. <b>Do not squander it.</b> Access to the unwilling donor has proven difficult since the harvesting, but if I am afforded the opportunity, I shall pass along your gratitude.\n</p><p><br>\nB.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203048\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1867/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31067/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8496/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935070/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   53.823      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   53.823      1 -total\n 64.65%   34.795      8 Template:Icon_text\n 59.22%   31.873     19 Template:Trim\n 34.92%   18.795      1 Template:PageSeo\n 34.80%   18.730      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 24.88%   13.390      2 Template:CharLink\n 24.69%   13.289      2 Template:Uid\n 23.85%   12.839      3 Template:Icon_link\n 18.86%   10.152      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:32287-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203048 and revision id 390549. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}